<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>About {{ company.name }}</h1>
  <p>Boab Ridge started in {{ company.founded }} as a two-person fitting and welding business in Welshpool, Perth. The founders did one thing well: they turned up, fixed the machine and went home with the job recorded properly. Word spread among Pilbara maintenance supervisors.</p>
  <h2>Our story</h2>
  <ul class="timeline">
    <li><strong>2011</strong> Two fitters, one workshop.</li>
    <li><strong>2015</strong> The first long-term contract with a Pilbara mine operator.</li>
    <li><strong>2019</strong> A remote site office opens in the Pilbara and the company grows to about 40 staff.</li>
    <li><strong>2022</strong> A place on the panel of a large mine operator that is part of an international group.</li>
    <li><strong>2026</strong> About 60 staff and three client contracts.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Two places, one company</h2>
  <p>About 45 people work from our Perth head office (management, finance, planning, engineering and IT). About 15 work at our remote site office in the Pilbara, with rostered contractors rotating through on two 12-hour shifts. The site never waits for Perth to wake up.</p>

