  <h2 id="fiction">This company is fictional</h2>
  <div class="notice">
    <p><strong>Boab Ridge Mining Services does not exist.</strong> It is the example business for an open server-security lab: a small company with a head office, a remote site and a handful of servers that students build, attack and then harden. Its people, address, phone number, dates and figures are invented. The phone number is in a range reserved for fiction. Any resemblance to a real business or person is accidental.</p>
    <p>You are welcome to reuse the company and this website in your own teaching or practice lab.</p>
